# apps/kingdom-tactics-server/src

Node entry point for the Kingdom Tactics multiplayer server. Mirrors `apps/game-server`:
an Express 5 service bootstrapped through `@shatteredarchive/services-server`
(`getConfigFromEnv` + `createExpressService`) with Winston logging and a `/health` probe.
This app is the server-authoritative match host — later steps mount a `/ws/kt` WebSocket
gateway that owns a `GameEngine` per match (from `@shatteredarchive/kingdom-tactics-engine`),
validates each client action against seat + engine legality, broadcasts state snapshots, and
can seat an `IAiPolicy` (GreedyPolicy) opponent. All game rules live in the engine; this app
is transport + match-lifecycle glue only.
